## 📋 Scenario

A small company has deployed a new Ubuntu server for its IT department.

Two new system administrators and one software developer have joined the company.

The Linux administrator must create the required user accounts, organize them into security groups, configure file permissions and ensure that administrative privileges are granted only to authorized users.

The objective is to implement a secure and organized access control model following Linux administration best practices.

